---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="About StudyPath | StudyPath"><main class="container py-14"><a class="text-sm font-bold text-teal-700" href={base}>← Back to StudyPath</a><article class="surface mt-6 max-w-4xl p-7 md:p-10"><p class="eyebrow teal">STUDYPATH</p><h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold">About StudyPath</h1><p class="muted mt-5 leading-8">StudyPath is an independent, zero-cost educational information and planning platform. It helps students explore destinations, institutions, programmes and funding references, then organise their own research. The first version is a static website hosted on GitHub Pages. It does not provide admissions decisions, immigration advice, application submission, secure accounts or cloud storage. Catalogue entries are collected from existing StudyPath data and publicly available institutional catalogue references. Each visitor should confirm current information with the relevant university, scholarship provider or government authority. The platform initially prioritises clear information for students from Bangladesh while remaining useful to applicants from other countries.</p><p class="muted mt-5 text-sm">Repository: <a class="font-bold text-teal-700" href="https://github.com/mdmominul-islam/scholarship-tracker" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">StudyPath on GitHub</a></p></article></main></BaseLayout>